{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A UNIQUE TAKE ON THE GENRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shobatsu is a fierce 2D action brawler with Hack'n Slash elements such as fast-paced action, effective defensive and evasive moves, and combo-intensive combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to succeed against the game's tough opponents, players will have to master the great variety of moves and preserve their health as much as possible, as health replenishment is not freely available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/extras/DEMO.gif?t=1745203906\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is single-player mode only and includes one skippable cutscene followed by one full stage divided in 3 parts: 2 sub-stages in which the player must defeat numerous normal enemies and the final arena in which a powerful enemy (stage boss) awaits the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One playable character with a full set of moves is available in the demo. Controls are fully customizable at the Controls menu in the Main menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652880?t=1745203906","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/022d6b3e828e502fbb314423e413086cffd2d21d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745203906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/5ccc897eb94c0753e8957512340b72d51752a62b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745203906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/5ccc897eb94c0753e8957512340b72d51752a62b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745203906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A UNIQUE TAKE ON THE GENRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shobatsu is a fierce 2D action brawler with Hack'n Slash elements such as fast-paced action, effective defensive and evasive moves, and combo-intensive combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to succeed against the game's tough opponents, players will have to master the great variety of moves and preserve their health as much as possible, as health replenishment is not freely available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/extras/DEMO.gif?t=1745203906\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is single-player mode only and includes one skippable cutscene followed by one full stage divided in 3 parts: 2 sub-stages in which the player must defeat numerous normal enemies and the final arena in which a powerful enemy (stage boss) awaits the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One playable character with a full set of moves is available in the demo. Controls are fully customizable at the Controls menu in the Main menu.</p>","developers":["UtopicNinjaWorks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3015720","name":"Shobatsu"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652880/2843bbc51017bac010c48c9a594e327cb2f240b8/header.jpg?t=1745203906","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123510,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123510/movie480.mp4?t=1744974394","max":"http://video.akamai.s